}},{"title":"寄蒋用文院判 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"旦气清明体力轻，未堪鸣佩拜彤庭。\n缉熙斋里熏金鸭，应著医经几卷成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2251,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简胡学士索木芙蓉栽 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"牡丹芍药皆姱丽，总怯风霜不耐秋。\n只好芙蓉伴修竹，清华晚映北窗幽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2252,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简胡学士索木芙蓉栽 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"闻种拒霜遮水槛，春前分乞数枝栽。\n总知宋玉才情绝，会约花时作赋来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2253,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽颜子明 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"五彩春霞绣绮袍，文章无复看挥毫。\n相思惟有南山色，彷佛当年意气高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2254,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽颜子明 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"贵里侯家甲第开，经过长是勒车回。\n守玄宅里寻常到，此去何因更一来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2255,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽颜子明 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"南浦江山一旦空，行吟谁复继高踪。\n薇垣柏府多知己，犹为传经惜马融。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2256,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日怀黄学士 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"年年赐宴捧萸觞，同沐皇恩近御床。\n今日江南望江北，不知何处醉重阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2257,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日怀黄学士 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"去时相约看黄花，花满园林未到家。\n惆怅别来无一字，西风极目雁行斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2258,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梁本之纳溪教谕 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"西过泸洲是纳溪，锦江还在纳溪西。\n此去家乡五十里，青山朝暮对猿啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2259,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梁本之纳溪教谕 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"烟楠雾柏富奇材，梁柱还须匠石裁。\n刀布不劳赍计吏，圣朝今选学官来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2260,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早至仪真","author":"杨士奇","text":"白沙岸头秋气清，仪真郭里早潮生。\n五云北望金台路，初是朝天第一程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2261,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早至淮安","author":"杨士奇","text":"百丈牵船夜未休，满衣凉露不胜秋。\n前林欲近闻鸡唱，城郭昽昽见楚州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2262,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜过徐州","author":"杨士奇","text":"怒涛翻河乱石横，牵船上洪初月明。\n夜中不辨黄楼处，惟听层城钟鼓声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2263,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望济宁","author":"杨士奇","text":"疏翠轻红水岸迂，渔家远近映菰蒲。\n高城前望晴云下，却记行程是半途。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2264,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花园望北京","author":"杨士奇","text":"黄金宫阙望都门，预喜明朝谒圣君。\n万岁山高腾王气，五云天上焕龙文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2265,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉天门早见后午被召至右顺门晚退口号","author":"杨士奇","text":"紫禁西连万岁山，宣呼重入觐龙颜。\n拜承圣语丁宁训，满袖天香出九关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2266,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早过良乡","author":"杨士奇","text":"马上风沙拂面飞，凝霜如雪堕征衣。\n平明行尽良乡郭，茅屋人家未启扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2267,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莫州同王邦彦张伯原饮道傍民家","author":"杨士奇","text":"雄县城南水没路，莫州市里酒如油。\n客行相聚且一醉，不见越人空古丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2268,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阻风雪德州有怀王邦彦司直","author":"杨士奇","text":"萧条风雪夜深寒，短棹临津欲发难。\n却忆故人单骑去，谁家茅店解征鞍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2269,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过安山驿怀金公素","author":"杨士奇","text":"共买兰舟北去时，尚书相送此分违。\n伤心未抵今朝重，万里承恩只独归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2270,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张令赴麻阳","author":"杨士奇","text":"乱山蛮树向人低，遥绾铜章赴五溪。\n为想春风与嘉政，新年俱到夜郎西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2271,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陆伴读伯阳草书后","author":"杨士奇","text":"兰绕春庭露气清，往年同咏谢宣城。\n龙蛇满纸看遗墨，忽乱山阳笛里情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2272,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅送胡方大归庐陵","author":"杨士奇","text":"葭菼萧条半著霜，故人迢递溯归航。\n东风无限江南意，因尔牵情万里长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2273,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡学士在北京闻予病寄诗慰问次韵奉酬 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"玉堂新署绿阴凉，日想承宣近御床。\n班马雄词真特达，唐虞化日正舒长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2274,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡学士在北京闻予病寄诗慰问次韵奉酬 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"平明阊阖九天开，玉佩趋朝百辟来。\n圣主正需调鼎用，诸公应荐和羹梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2275,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡学士在北京闻予病寄诗慰问次韵奉酬 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"盛世才华翰苑多，龙光星彩贯天河。\n自怜同在承恩地，不奈频年远别何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2276,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡学士在北京闻予病寄诗慰问次韵奉酬 其四","author":"杨士奇","text":"头白目昏过五十，不禁四体病交攻。\n君恩未有涓埃报，却怪书来感叹同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2277,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡学士在北京闻予病寄诗慰问次韵奉酬 其五","author":"杨士奇","text":"绣锦传来五色丝，翔鸾翥凤粲离离。\n知公头白丹心在，况是文章老不衰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2278,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡学士在北京闻予病寄诗慰问次韵奉酬 其六","author":"杨士奇","text":"朝回清坐广文毡，病起閒逃苏晋禅。\n了彻六尘成梦觉，迩来三月已无眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2279,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡学士在北京闻予病寄诗慰问次韵奉酬 其七","author":"杨士奇","text":"尽恋长生养性灵，力求大药扣玄扃。\n庄生自有逍遥论，不道千龄胜百龄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2280,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红心驿","author":"杨士奇","text":"马头近见红心驿，茅屋参差半酒家。\n潇洒赤栏桥外柳，西风吹折数枝斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2281,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿临淮营梦种子 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"肠断经年隔死生，因何随梦到行营。\n营前淮水深千丈，得及人间父子情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2282,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿临淮营梦种子 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"绕膝踉跄捧一编，分明梦里见娟娟。\n临淮营内中宵月，应照来生未了缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2283,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早过宿州","author":"杨士奇","text":"月转西林晓雾收，霜华如雪拥貂裘。\n马前清景山无数，带得馀酣过宿州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2284,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪谒徐王庙","author":"杨士奇","text":"闵子乡中询父老，徐王庙下驻旂旄。\n庙前山势如鸾凤，万古涂山相对高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2285,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"范增墓","author":"杨士奇","text":"千年宝剑无光气，衰草寒烟野水邻。\n同是遗骸葬徐土，当时陵母识天人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2286,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]